# Model routing (Pelbu) — protect spend

## Truth

Cursor **rules cannot change the chat model**. You must pick the model in the Agent dropdown. This rule only says **which** to pick so we do not burn on-demand.

Cursor has **two separate monthly pools** ([usage limits](https://cursor.com/help/models-and-usage/usage-limits.md)):

| Pool | Models | When over budget |
|------|--------|------------------|
| **Cursor Models** (included, usually still has room) | **Composer** / **Composer 2.5**, **Grok 4.5** | Prefer these |
| **Other Models** (Claude, GPT, Gemini, listed third-party) | Claude / GPT / Gemini / etc. | **Do not pick** if dashboard shows ≥100% — that is on-demand $ |

Check remaining room: [cursor.com/dashboard/usage](https://cursor.com/dashboard/usage) / [Spending](https://cursor.com/dashboard/spending).

## Default picks (cost-safe)

| Chat purpose | Select in Agent picker | Pool / bill |
|--------------|------------------------|-------------|
| Everyday Agent, implement, review in this chat | **Composer** (or Composer 2.5) | Cursor Models — included |
| Hard architecture / schema / money-path bugs | **Grok 4.5** (still included) or Composer | Cursor Models — included |
| Bulk UI in a **second** chat (file-scoped brief) | **`GLM-5.2`** (z.ai override on) | z.ai Coding Plan — not Cursor Other Models |
| Avoid unless Other Models has headroom | Claude / GPT / Gemini / Auto Balance·Intelligence | Other Models — on-demand when over |

**Never** leave the picker on Claude/GPT when Other Models is already over (e.g. 141%). That spends.

If using **Auto**, prefer **Auto → Cost** only. Avoid Balance / Intelligence — they can route into Other Models.

## Cap accidental spend

- Dashboard: disable **on-demand** or set a **spend limit** so Agent stops instead of charging.
- Unused included quota does **not** roll over; it resets on the billing cycle date.

## z.ai setup (implementer chat only)

- Custom model name: **`GLM-5.2`** (uppercase)
- Override OpenAI Base URL: **`https://api.z.ai/api/coding/paas/v4`**
- API key: Z.AI key (Coding Plan), not OpenRouter
- After adding: pick **`GLM-5.2`** in the Agent menu for that chat
- **Turn off** OpenAI Base URL override before switching back to Composer / Grok / other Cursor-native models

## Agents / Task tool

Background Task subagents **cannot** use `GLM-5.2` — only Cursor allowlisted models. Prefer **Composer** for Task/subagents so they stay on the included Cursor Models pool. For GLM work, open a **second chat** with GLM selected instead.
